3d2e39c fix(arena): close game connection and cached backend clients on every exit path (G5)
784fc1c fix(arena): classify agent/GameState construction failures as harness crashes (G4)
a646ce2 fix(arena): recognize real Tier-2 reload successes, mark unverifiable reloads distinctly (G2, G3)
93099bb fix(arena): stop scoring never-dispatched calls as successes, fabricating 0 mutations (G1, G14)

